' Authored by: Emmanuel A. Otchere (cardinal author rule, 2026-09-23)
'
' Autonomous Operations relational diagram
'
' Per CR-ES-008 §22 + ADR-ES-008 §25 + §26 + §28.
' Illustrates the 10 canonical relationships (specializes ;; operates-within ;;;
' governed-by ;; pursues ;; responds-to ;; produces ;; adapts-to ;; escalates-to ;;
' uses [workflow + agentic-workflow]) plus the Operations parent.

@startuml autonomous-operations

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 10

skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor #F0F8FF
    BorderColor #4682B4
}

title Autonomous Operations ;;; Relational Model

' Core Autonomous Operations class

rectangle "Autonomous Operations\n(ES:CONCEPT:autonomous-operations)" as aoo #FFE4B5

' Specialization parent

rectangle "Operations\n(ES:CONCEPT:operations)" as ops #F0FFF0

' Authority + policy + objective

rectangle "Authority\n(ES:CONCEPT:authority)" as auth #E0FFFF
rectangle "Policy\n(external:concept:policy)" as policy #FFE4E1
rectangle "Operational\nObjective\n(external:concept:operational-objective)" as obj #FFE4E1

' Operational context + outcome

rectangle "Operational Context\n(external:concept:operational-context)" as oc #FFFACD
rectangle "Operational Outcome\n(external:concept:operational-outcome)" as outcome #E0FFE0

' Escalation target

rectangle "Human / Authority\n(external:concept:human-authority)" as ha #FFE4E1

' Workflow targets

rectangle "Workflow\n(ES:CONCEPT:workflow)" as wf #F0FFF0
rectangle "Agentic Workflow\n(ES:CONCEPT:agentic-workflow)" as awf #FFE4B5

' Relationships

aoo --|> ops : specializes

aoo --> auth : operates-within
aoo --> policy : governed-by
aoo --> obj : pursues

aoo --> oc : responds-to
aoo --> oc : adapts-to

aoo --> outcome : produces

aoo --> ha : escalates-to

aoo --> wf : uses
aoo --> awf : uses

note bottom of aoo
  Per CR-ES-008 §6 + ADR-ES-008 §1 + §2 + §25 + §26.
  Autonomous Operations specialises Operations ;;
  preserves Operations semantics ;;
  adds 8 characteristics ;; 12 properties ;;
  10 canonical relationships ;;
  10 invariants.
end note

note right of aoo
  Per ADR-ES-008 §4 + §26 ;;
  Autonomous Operations is orthogonal
  to Agentic Operations ;; distinct
  semantic dimension ;; NOT a
  specialisation.
end note

note bottom of ops
  Per CR-ES-008 §5 + ADR-ES-008 §5 ;;
  Operations is established by
  FND-ES-AG-004 ;;; ES-canonical
  established at v1.0.0.
end note

@enduml